---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+19195550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(919) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Strange Noises from AC | AC Repair Wake Forest NC" description="Rattling, grinding, or squealing AC noises — what they mean and how we fix them.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Strange Noises from AC</h1>
      <p>Rattling, grinding, or squealing AC noises — what they mean and how we fix them.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
      <p>Unusual sounds are early warnings. Grinding often points to motor bearings, rattling to loose panels or debris, squealing to a failing belt or bearing, and banging to a failing compressor or fan blade.</p>
      <p>Ignoring noise can turn a simple repair into a compressor replacement. Call early for a diagnosis.</p>
      <h2>Get Help Today</h2>
      <p>Don't wait in the heat. Call <a href={`tel:${phone}`}>(919) 555-0199</a> for same-day diagnosis and repair in Wake Forest, Rolesville, and surrounding areas.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call (919) 555-0199</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>